{
  "api": {
    "title": "CampusMate 定时任务管理 API",
    "version": "1.11.0",
    "basePath": "/mate-service/v1",
    "visibility": "Public · 待评审 · 待实现"
  },
  "operation": {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/schedules/{scheduleId}/run",
    "summary": "立即运行定时任务",
    "description": "用户保存任务后想马上验证任务内容和凭据能否正常工作，不必等到下次计划时间。Mate 先检查任务对当前用户可见，再调用 Claw 用已保存的配置运行一次：接口配置的任务新建会话，对话中创建的任务在原对话追加一轮。这是实际执行，会产生业务副作用。返回本次 Run，sessionId 换成 chatId；只表示会话已受理或受理失败，不等待执行结束。本接口不定义请求头，前端调用时 Mate 框架已完成 access-token 校验。",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "in": "path",
        "name": "scheduleId",
        "required": true,
        "schema": "string, schedule-{32 位十六进制}",
        "description": "创建或列表返回的任务 ID，原样传回，不按名称查找，不自行构造；格式非法由 Claw 返回 400"
      }
    ],
    "requestBody": {
      "required": false,
      "contentType": "none",
      "description": "无请求体，也没有 query 参数；不能临时覆盖 prompt、agentId 或时间规则，带非空正文（包括 {}）由 Claw 返回 400。active、paused、有 Cron 或只能手动运行的任务都可以立即运行，运行不改变任务状态和下次计划时间。每次调用都是一次新的运行，页面应防止重复点击。"
    },
    "responses": [
      {
        "id": "200-ok",
        "status": "200",
        "tabLabel": "200 · Run",
        "label": "OK",
        "summary": "本次运行已记录。chatId 与 error 恰好一个非空：受理成功时 chatId 为结果对话、error 为 null；受理失败时 chatId 为 null、error 给出原因。resCode 为 0 不表示业务执行成功，页面必须检查 error。Chat 映射暂时查不到时 chatId 也为 null 且 error 为 null，页面显示“结果入口准备中”，不能因此再次运行。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "受理成功": {
            "resCode": "0",
            "resMsg": "success",
            "result": {
              "type": "schedule_run",
              "id": "run-734915adff6345c9bb67e3746c64dc25",
              "scheduleId": "schedule-927e03d2a4784f90a6238e790539c6e4",
              "agentId": "agent-550e8400e29b41d4a716446655440000",
              "triggerContext": {
                "type": "manual"
              },
              "chatId": "c7d8e9f0a1b2433c8d4e5f60718293a4",
              "error": null,
              "createdAt": "2026-10-21T02:00:00Z"
            }
          },
          "同一任务仍在运行": {
            "resCode": "0",
            "resMsg": "success",
            "result": {
              "type": "schedule_run",
              "id": "run-407b1f6d15264bf384fd69ce727f1276",
              "scheduleId": "schedule-927e03d2a4784f90a6238e790539c6e4",
              "agentId": "agent-550e8400e29b41d4a716446655440000",
              "triggerContext": {
                "type": "manual"
              },
              "chatId": null,
              "error": {
                "type": "schedule_busy_error",
                "message": "该定时任务仍有进行中或待核对的运行。"
              },
              "createdAt": "2026-10-21T02:01:00Z"
            }
          },
          "关联对话正忙": {
            "resCode": "0",
            "resMsg": "success",
            "result": {
              "type": "schedule_run",
              "id": "run-5a6b7c8d9e0f41a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0",
              "scheduleId": "schedule-1f2e3d4c5b6a47988a7b6c5d4e3f2a1b",
              "agentId": "agent-550e8400e29b41d4a716446655440000",
              "triggerContext": {
                "type": "manual"
              },
              "chatId": null,
              "error": {
                "type": "session_busy_error",
                "message": "关联的对话正忙，本次已跳过。"
              },
              "createdAt": "2026-10-21T02:02:00Z"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "400-schedule-request-invalid",
        "status": "400",
        "tabLabel": "400 · SCHEDULE_REQUEST_INVALID",
        "label": "Bad Request",
        "summary": "scheduleId 格式非法、带了 query 参数或非空请求体。Claw 校验，错误码原样返回。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_REQUEST_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "定时任务请求无效。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_REQUEST_INVALID",
            "resMsg": "Invalid schedule request."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "404-schedule-not-found",
        "status": "404",
        "tabLabel": "404 · SCHEDULE_NOT_FOUND",
        "label": "Not Found",
        "summary": "任务不存在、已删除，或对当前用户不可见，三种情况结果相同；Mate 判断不可见时不调用 Claw。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_NOT_FOUND",
            "resMsg": "定时任务不存在或不可访问。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_NOT_FOUND",
            "resMsg": "Schedule not found or not accessible."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "500-schedule-run-failed",
        "status": "500",
        "tabLabel": "500 · SCHEDULE_RUN_FAILED",
        "label": "Internal Server Error",
        "summary": "Claw 内部失败，没有形成可靠的运行记录。不要直接重发，先查看该任务的 Run 列表。Mate 读取 t_schedule 失败时返回 Mate 通用 500，此时没有调用 Claw。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_RUN_FAILED",
            "resMsg": "发起定时任务失败，请稍后核对运行记录。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_RUN_FAILED",
            "resMsg": "Failed to initiate the schedule. Check run history before retrying."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "503-schedule-service-unavailable",
        "status": "503",
        "tabLabel": "503 · SCHEDULE_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE",
        "label": "Service Unavailable",
        "summary": "Claw 不可达、证书校验失败，或结果未知（超时、断连）。Mate 不自动重试；本次可能已经运行，页面先查看该任务的 Run 列表再决定是否重新运行。",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store",
          "Content-Language": "zh-CN"
        },
        "bodies": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "resMsg": "定时任务服务暂不可用，请查看运行记录确认是否已发起。"
          },
          "en-US": {
            "resCode": "SCHEDULE_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE",
            "resMsg": "The schedule service is temporarily unavailable. Check run history to see whether the run started."
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "review": {
    "questions": [],
    "followUpTitle": "立即运行接口待评审",
    "promptPrefix": "更新 POST /mate-service/v1/schedules/{scheduleId}/run",
    "promptSuffix": "保持与 CampusMate 定时任务设计 §4.2 和 Claw 立即运行接口同步。"
  }
}
